 table beauty.\n\nThrough personal photography and slideshow narration of h
 er recent trip to England\, Barbara Ellis \\(one of our longtime Master Co
 nsulting Rosarians\\) will take us to the grounds of Holker Hall\, Gresgar
 th Hall\, Littlethorpe Manor\, Mottisfont Abbey\, and Coton Manor\, and mo
 re. From grand country estates and celebrated landscapes to intimate garde
 n rooms overflowing with roses and perennial borders\, this program is you
 r virtual ticket across the pond to discover inspired planting combination
 s\, distinctive garden design\, historic roses\, and plenty of ideas to br
 ing home to your own garden.\n\n..........................................
