SUMMARY:Laugh Your Pickkleball Off!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T130000
UID:260830fp-wfcvqKEOrqzcD4RNTVQ
DESCRIPTION:Laugh Your Pickleball Off!™ is more than a pickleball event
 —it's a chance to make a lasting impact—it's a celebration with a purp
 ose! Every registration\, sponsorship\, and donation helps enrich the live
 s of children with autism\, support their families\, and create lasting op
 portunities for growth and connection.\n\nTwo Unforgettable Days:​Septem
 ber 17 & 18\, 2026​ - Third Annual! \n\nThe 2-day event features:\n\n- P
 ickleball clinics with APP World \\#1 pro and two-time USAP National Champ
 ion Jill Braverman\n\n- Play with a Pro exhibition games\n\n- All-levels p
 ickleball Round-robin\n\n-Finale Comedy Show with headliner Shawn Pelofsky
 !\n\n- And more! —all raising funds to support children with autism and 
 their families.\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable night of stand-up comedy f
 eaturing acclaimed comedian\, actress\, writer\, and producer Shawn Pelofs
 ky—a Comedy Store Main Room\, Laugh Factory\, and Hollywood Improv regul
 ar who performs for our troops\, with credits including Community\, Chelse
 a Lately\, and Amazon’s Stretch It Out! Shawn is also a producer on the 
 hit show Funny You Should Ask!\n\nThe indoor Championship Court at Centerl
 ine 33 Pickleball Complex in Rohnert Park—formerly a movie theater—bec
 omes the setting for a one-of-a-kind comedy show\, where the original thea
 ter seats still provide the best seats in the house. Because comedy belong
 s everywhere even on a pickleball court. \n\nWhether you're a pickleball 
 fan\, a comedy lover\, or simply looking for a unique night out\, bring yo
 ur friends and enjoy an evening of laughter for a great cause.
LOCATION:Centerline 33
URL:https://www.crushersofcomedy.com/sept182026.html
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
