SUMMARY:SENIOR RESOURCE FAIR
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T160000
UID:260820TkcTAes_i0qzjLF-kZDMgg
DESCRIPTION:Come hang out and discover tons of helpful resources and fun s
 tuff made just for seniors!\n\nSenior Resource Fair 🌟\n\n📅 Septembe
 r 18\, 2026 ⏰ 1:00 PM-4:00 PM 📍 850 Sonoma Ave\n\nCome join us for 
