UID:260528VDQoa0diR0u7GUeHRgaDtw
DESCRIPTION:Produced by Teatro Alebrijes del Valle and presented in part
 nership with Shakespeare Napa Valley. Founded by NVC alumnus Andres Ag
 ustin Barrera\, Teatro Alebrijes del Valle brings professional Latino th
 eater to the Studio Theater for ten performances across two weekends. Barr
