BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Workshop: Platen Press Fundamentals
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T150000
UID:260713FhmQfKvD4UqUi8CH00rjjQ
DESCRIPTION:PLATEN PRESS FUNDAMENTALS Master the platen press by designing
  and printing your own edition of letterpress greeting cards. This worksho
 p focuses on the specific techniques and rhythm of platen press operation-
 feeding paper\, achieving even impression\, and producing clean\, consiste
 nt prints. You'll set metal type to create one card design\, then print an
  edition of 15 cards to take home. Through hands-on practice\, you'll lear
 n makeready\, lockup\, ink coverage\, and troubleshooting common press iss
 ues. By the end of the workshop\, you'll understand how to operate a plate
 n press confidently and have beautiful cards ready to send or gift. Ideal 
 for printers who want to add platen press skills to their repertoire and c
 reate functional\, finished work. third saturdays\\* 10:00am - 3:00pm \\*n
 o class in November
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/workshop-platen-press-fundamentals/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
