BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Culinary Student Lunch Pop-UP
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260923T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260923T130000
UID:260911Drh9Cf0zU0i2jArlGJZCQw
DESCRIPTION:Our Culinary Student Pop-Up Lunch Cafe is back! There will be 
 two lunch service windows: Wednesday through Friday on September 16th-18t
 h and again 23rd-25th\, 11:30 AM to 1 PM. This tradition marks the culmina
 tion of our current adult culinary job training cohort in Petaluma\, with 
 every dish on the menu inspired and shaped by the students themselves. It'
 s a chance for our trainees to put their new skills to the test working th
 e line in a real service setting - and for you to taste what they've been 
 working on and cheer them on as they graduate into their next chapter.\n\n
 Consider treating your whole team or company to lunch those weeks - it's a
  great way to support our students while feeding your crew! There’s limi
 ted space to eat onsite\, so please plan to pick up\, take it with you\, a
 nd enjoy.\n\nHead to sonomafamilymeal.org for the full menu and option t
 o place your order online in advance.
LOCATION:Sonoma Family Meal Community Kitchen
URL:http://sonomafamilymeal.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
