DESCRIPTION:Classical guitar enthusiasts and music lovers are in for a tre
 at as the internationally acclaimed guitarist Andrea González Caballero b
 rings her Spanish and Latin American repertoire to Napa.\n\nAfter the sens
 ational launch of her album "Reencuentros" and a triumphant tour across th
 e United States Europe and Australia\, Caballero is set to perform at the 
 First Presbyterian Church Napa.
LOCATION:First Presbyterian Church of Napa
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108758434?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
