 hase.\n\nPlus visit The Owens Sisters Spritz Bar\, where guests can begin 
 with our signature wine spritzer and make it their own with enchanting gar
 den embellishments: rosemary for luck\, citrus for happiness\, berries for
  love\, and edible flowers for a little extra magic. Consider it your own 
 garden-grown potion\, best enjoyed under the stars.\n\nWith more magical m
 oments throughout the evening. We can't wait to host you in your best witc
 hy looks.\n\n$10 per guest
