 owd-friendly sounds of **Rootstocks** with delicious **wood-fired pizzas f
 rom Casa Nostra**.\n\nRootstocks brings an energetic mix of familiar favor
 ites and feel-good tunes\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed a
 nd social evening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Lo
 ngboard’s wines by the glass or bottle while Casa Nostra serves their si
 gnature wood-fired pizzas\, made fresh on site with quality ingredients.\n
 \n**Friday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM** **Free entry**\n\n**Please note:** This
  is an **over-21 event inside** the Barrel Room. **Under-21 guests and lea
 shed pets are welcome on the patio only.**\n\nCome grab a seat early and e
