 Abbot’s Passage\\)\n\nSonoma Barracks\n\nSaturday\, September 26th: 6pm\
 n\nThe Sonoma Valley Grand Tasting is an elegant evening of wine tasting u
 nder the stars at the historic Sonoma Barracks. Guests will explore the di
 verse wines and growing regions of Sonoma Valley\, sampling an exceptional
  selection from over 40 wineries. This walk-around tasting event offers th
 e chance to meet winemakers and winegrowers\, enjoy current vintages from 
 all six Sonoma Valley appellations\, and savor locally prepared cuisine fr
 om top chefs and artisans. \n\nMore event news to come through 2026…
