BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Crane Creek Cuvée Vertical Mingle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T180000
UID:260128s34EImiq-ki-7A-cWdtPXA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an intimate afternoon celebrating the power and pe
 rsonality of Crane Creek Cuvée. Together\, we'll explore a vertical lineu
 p of our flagship red blend from Sonoma County\, diving into the nuance th
 at each vintage reveals. This curated experience highlights the elegance\,
  structure\, and age-worthy depth that define this iconic wine. Through gu
 ided conversation and side-by-side tasting\, you'll discover how vintage v
 ariation\, vineyard expression\, and winemaking choices shape Crane Creek 
 Cuvée&'s unmistakable character. A can't-miss event for collectors\, Merl
 ot devotees\, and anyone curious to experience the remarkable story this v
 ineyard tells year after year.
