BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T183000
UID:2609125j8S1B9DzECRfuNWhPzCtQ
DESCRIPTION:**Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert & Potluck After-P
 arty**\n\n**Concert 5:00-6:30 p.m. | Potluck 6:30-7:30 p.m.**\n\nEnjoy an 
 evening of live traditional Irish and Americana music in a beautiful setti
 ng\, with a bit of Irish dance\, and a potluck after-party to celebrate th
 e Harvest Moon!\n\n**HARDLY STRICTLY IRISH** (Suzuki Cady and Jimmy Murphy
 ) bring an uplifting\, warm\, and soulful energy\, and a signature blend o
 f traditional Irish tunes and Appalachian\, country-folk\, and roots-Ameri
 cana songs. Their rich sound features the fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, ban
 jo\, bodhrán\, and vocal harmonies.\n\nShiloh Step Irish Dance of Santa R
 osa will give a brief demo at intermission and can teach you a few ceili (
 group dance) steps during the potluck after-party. Bring a potluck dish (o
 ptional) to share after the show in honor of the Harvest Moon.\n\nSt. Step
 hen's sanctuary is beautiful\, has great acoustics\, comfortable seats\, r
 oom to dance\, and easy parking. Its outdoor sacred space has a fountain a
 nd seating for enjoying your potluck after the show.\n\n500 Robinson Road\
 , Sebastopol CA\n\n**TICKETS: https://tixfox.co/e/harvestmoon**\n\nGENERAL
  (Advance) $25/$20 Seniors and Youth | (At the Door\, if not sold out) $35
 /$30 (Doors at 4:30 p.m.)\n\nVideos of the band: http://suzukicady.com/vid
 eos
LOCATION:St. Stephen's Sanctuary
URL:https://tixfox.co/e/harvestmoon
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
