 ow:** 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n🎤 **Live Performa
 nces**\n\nWatch local performers bring their best to the Highly Talented s
 tage.\n\n⭐ **Live Judges**\n\nOur judges will be watching\, reacting\, 
