 mission tickets.\n\n**A Talent Show With a Little Extra Spark.**\n\n**21+ 
 Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC**\n\n**Event Terms & Conditions**\n\nThis eve
 nt is **21+ only**. A valid government-issued ID is required for entry.\n
 \nBy attending an event at **The Lounge at Mercy**\, you acknowledge that
