  10 days from September 18 – 28 at Solano County Fairgrounds. Experience
  the magic of an old-world European-style circus that has been dazzling fa
 milies around the world since 1842\, right here in Vallejo\, CA. Acrobats\
 , animals\, comedy and heartfelt connection in an intimate big top where n
 o seat is more than 20 feet from the ring. Join us as we celebrate life\, 
 circus\, and family.\n\nShowtimes: Monday\, Thursday and Fridays at 6 p.m.
  Saturdays at 1 p.m.\, 4 p.m. and 7 p.m. - Sundays at 1 p.m. and 4 p.m.\n\
