BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:RIVER + REDWOODS FILM FESTIVAL
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T223000
UID:260806HOqrT7zg_0S2F3UvVmMnsA
DESCRIPTION:**Join us for the River & Redwoods Film Festival (RRFF)\, Sept
 ember 25-27\, at the historic Monte Rio Theater. The Festival is a 3 day c
 elebration of independent films\, networking\, community\, and Russian Riv
 er fun!**\n\n**THE PROGRAM SHOWCASES THE BEST OF BAY AREA CINEMA**\n\nRRFF
  will showcase narrative features\, documentaries\, shorts\, student work\
 , and emerging voices from the Bay Area and beyond. This year’s Festival
  lineup includes more than 20 films that reflect the creativity and range 
 of the North Bay and Bay Area\, with filmmakers and artists represented fr
 om Monte Rio\, Occidental\, Forestville\, Santa Rosa\, Sebastopol\, Sea Ra
 nch\, San Francisco\, Oakland\, and beyond.  \n\nMany of our films have 
 recently screened at prestigious festivals including Tribeca Film Festival
 \, SF International Film Festival\, FRAMELINE LGBTQ+ Film Festival and man
 y more.\n\n**OUR FILM FESTIVAL IS UNIQUE**\n\nFestival events center aroun
 d the historic Monte Rio Theater and nearby venues\, creating an intimate 
 small‑town setting where filmmakers and audiences actually meet\, talk\,
  and connect.\n\nWhether you’re an industry professional\, an aspiring f
 ilmmaker\, or simply someone who loves discovering new stories on the big 
 screen\, River & Redwoods offers a welcoming space to experience films in 
 community.\n\n**GET TICKETS AND MORE FESTIVAL INFORMATION**\n\n\\>> Festiv
 al Tickets are now on sale! Get your tickets on our Festival Eventbrite pa
 ge https://riverandredwoodsfilmfest2026.eventbrite.com\n\n\\>> For more in
 formation about the River + Redwoods Film Festival and program\, head to h
 ttps://www.riverandredwoodsfilmfestival.com/home\n\n\\>> Join us on Instag
 ram for offers\, filmmaker interviews\, and the latest festival news @RIVE
 RREDWOODSFILMFESTIVAL\n\n\\>> For Volunteer Opportunities\, Sponsorship Op
 portunities and Accessibility Inquiries contact us at info@riverandredwood
 sfilmfestival.com
LOCATION:Monte Rio Theater and Extravaganza
URL:https://www.riverandredwoodsfilmfestival.com/home
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
