UID:260623ogBUufVHnUK6xap0kIMIfA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Greek Street Food Fest\, every year\, f
 rom 11am to 5pm! Admission and Parking is always free.\n\nCome and enjoy a
 uthentic Greek food which always draws people from all over the Bay Area t
 o our small church in Vallejo. It’s that good!\n\nOur offerings include:
  the classic Gyro\, Souvlaki\, Saganaki\, Calamari Rings and Greek Fries\,
  Greek Salad\, and Greek Pizza fired in a genuine wood fire oven. And if y
 ou’re craving something sweet\, our authentic Greek pastries and dessert
 s include Baklava and Loukoumades.\n\nIf you’d like to learn more about 
 the Greek Orthodox Church during the festival\, please check out our Holy 
 Cross Orthodox Bookstore upstairs in the Community Hall or join us for our
  evening Vespers service at 5pm once the festival ends.
