BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dancing Under the Stars - A 70s-Themed Disco Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T210000
UID:260912TglmFzCbvEiTCOXU6ovuKw
DESCRIPTION:Yountville Arts Presents &ldquo\;Dancing Under the Stars&rdquo
 \; &ndash\; A 70s-Themed Disco Night\n\nYountville\, CA &mdash\; October 2
 \, 2026 &mdash\; Yountville Arts invites the community to step back in tim
 e and groove under the night sky at &ldquo\;Dancing Under the Stars\,&rdqu
 o\; a vibrant\, 70s-inspired outdoor dance experience.\n\nTaking place on 
 Friday\, October 2\, 2026\, from 7:30 to 9:00 PM\, the Yountville Communit
 y Center Plaza will be transformed into a retro disco haven\, complete wit
 h classic beats\, lively energy\, and plenty of sparkle. This event is fre
 e to attend\, but reserving your tickets will assist us with planning. \n\
 nGuests will enjoy music from DJ Geoffrey Leigh\, spinning iconic hits fro
 m the disco era to keep the dance floor alive all evening. For those looki
 ng to sharpen their moves\, Tammy Cruze will lead an interactive session t
 eaching participants how to &ldquo\;hustle\,&rdquo\; making it easy for ev
 eryone&mdash\;from beginners to seasoned dancers&mdash\;to join in the fun
 .\n\nAttendees are encouraged to embrace the theme and come dressed in the
 ir best 70s-inspired attire&mdash\;think bell bottoms\, sequins\, platform
  shoes\, and all the disco vibes.\n\n&ldquo\;Dancing Under the Stars is al
 l about bringing our community together in a fun\, creative\, and energeti
 c way\,&rdquo\; said Yountville Arts. &ldquo\;We can't wait to see the pla
 za come alive with music\, dance\, and a little retro magic.&rdquo\;\n\nTh
 is family-friendly event is open to all and promises an unforgettable even
 ing of music\, movement\, and community connection under the stars.
LOCATION:Yountville Community Center
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/dancing-under-the-stars-a-
 70s-themed-disco-night?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
