 pen to the public Friday\, Oct 2 from 3 - 7pm\n\n- Saturday\, Oct 3 10 am 
 - 5 pm\n\n- Sunday\, Oct 4 HALF-PRICE DAY 10 am - 4 pm\n\n- Monday\, Oct 5
