DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T130000
UID:260822vWhJIWFdJ0umKRzZBDI7eg
DESCRIPTION:Mondays Weekly · 6 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nSeptember 14 – O
 ctober 19\, 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 1:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nCatego
